            "text": "<p>★★★★★<br/>Finally, bands that don't roll down<br/><br/>I've tried so many resistance bands and they always end up bunching or rolling mid-set. These stay exactly where I put them , through hip thrusts, squats, all of it. The heavy band gives me real resistance without feeling like it's cutting into my legs. My glutes have never been more sore after leg day. Worth every penny.<br/></p>",
            "author": "— Ashley M., verified buyer"
