        },
        "column_B6D3xg": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Perfect Fit for My Fitness Journey",
            "text": "<p>★★★★★<br/>My home gym essential<br/><br/>I travel a lot for work and these go everywhere with me. They pack flat in my bag and I can get a full glute and leg workout in a hotel room in 20 minutes. I started with the light band for warm-ups and now I use all three depending on the exercise. The fabric is thick and hasn't lost any stretch after months of use. Genuinely impressed.</p>",
            "author": "— Marcus T., verified buyer"
          }
